// Signing team for this Mac, kept out of git: XcodeGen regenerates the project and would drop a
// team picked in Xcode. Signing.local.xcconfig holds one line (scripts/ios-run.sh writes it once):
//   DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
// It can also set the bundle id (the screen extension is that id + ".screen"). The default is
// only registered for development on the wildcard profile; TestFlight needs an id registered on
// the team's own account (scripts/ios-archive.sh):
//   CAMSTUDIO_BUNDLE_ID = com.example.camstudio
CAMSTUDIO_BUNDLE_ID = vn.camstudio.phone
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
